我明你嘅要求，要用廣東話語法同字眼嚟造句。以下用你提供嘅詞語，一樣一句，盡量用廣東話口語感：

1. 飲茶
廣東話：我尋日同朋友去飲茶，叫咗好多點心。
English: I went to yum cha with my friends yesterday and ordered a lot of dim sum.

2. 圖書館
廣東話：你屋企附近有冇圖書館？
English: Is there a library near your home?

3. 養聲
廣東話：我近排好似聲帶有啲唔舒服，要畀養聲啲日先可以唱歌。
English: My vocal cords have been feeling a bit uncomfortable lately, so I need to rest my voice for a few days before I can sing again.

4. 票尾
廣東話：你買咗咗飛機票嗎？記得留住票尾，之後要用嚟報單。
English: Did you buy a plane ticket? Remember to keep the ticket stub, you'll need it for reimbursement later.

5. hacker
廣東話：有啲 hacker 會試嚟破解你嘅電腦，所以要畀多啲注意。
English: Some hackers will try to break into your computer, so you need to be more careful.

6. 石斛蘭
廣東話：呢度有啲石斛蘭，佢哋會依附喺樹上面生長。
English: There are some orchids here, they grow by attaching to trees.

7. 吊詭
廣東話：佢講嘅話同佢做嘅事好吊詭，真係似非而是。
English: What he says and what he does is very contradictory, it's really absurd.

8. 吊詭
廣東話：呢個情況好吊詭，越講越唔明。
English: This situation is very paradoxical, the more you talk about it the less you understand.

9. 各為其主
廣東話：喺公司入面，各部門都各為其主，唔會真係幫手。
English: In the company, each department is out for its own boss's interests, they won't really help each other.

10. 軨蓋
廣東話：佢車車嘅軨蓋好舊，開起嚟好吵。
English: The wheels on his cart are very old, it makes a lot of noise when he drives it.

11. 打哥夫
廣東話：我尋日去打哥夫，打得好爽。
English: I went to play golf yesterday, it felt great.

12. 免揀
廣東話：呢間店嘅貨品都係免揀，你買咩都唔可以揀。
English: Everything in this shop is sold without choice, you can't pick what you buy.

13. 擺闊佬
廣東話：佢喺街上面擺闊佬，買咗好多名牌包。
English: He's showing off his wealth on the street, buying lots of designer bags.

14. 廣播劇
廣東話：我尋年好鍾意聽廣播劇，每晚都會睇。
English: I used to love listening to radio dramas, I watched them every night.

15. 錄影機
廣東話：你有冇錄影機？我想拍一段紀念片。
English: Do you have a video camera? I want to record a memory video.

16. 吟詩吟唔甩
廣東話：佢講嘅證據真係吟詩吟唔甩，冇人可以抵賴。
English: The evidence he presents is irrefutable, no one can deny it.

17. 佈道大會
廣東話：呢度有一場佈道大會，好多人都去聽。
English: There's a missionary meeting here, many people went to listen.

18. 寫手
廣東話：佢係一個寫手，專門寫小說。
English: He's a writer, he specializes in writing novels.

19. 寫手
廣東話：我冇時間寫報告，就請人幫我做寫手。
English: I don't have time to write the report, so I hired someone to be my ghostwriter.

20. 代打
廣東話：我唔會打遊戲，就請人代打幫我。
English: I don't know how to play games, so I asked someone to play for me.

21. 茶碗
廣東話：我買咗一只茶碗，用嚟飲茶好有感觸。
English: I bought a tea bowl, it feels great to drink tea with it.

22. 茶隔
廣東話：茶隔可以將茶葉同茶湯分開，好有用。
English: A tea strainer can separate tea leaves from tea, it's very useful.

23. 只許州官放火，不准百姓點燈
廣東話：喺呢度，只許州官放火，不准百姓點燈，老百姓講嘢都受限制。
English: In this place, only officials can light fires, common people can't even light a lamp, ordinary people's speech is restricted.

24. 獨唱
廣東話：呢首歌係獨唱，冇合唱。
English: This song is a solo, there's no chorus.

25. 快人快事
廣東話：你做嘢都快人快事，唔使等人。
English: You do things quickly, you don't need to wait for others.

26. 四腳獸
廣東話：我喺廁所外面睇到四腳獸，真係好震驚。
English: I saw a "four-legged beast" outside the toilet, it was really shocking.

27. 無米粥
廣東話：我哋先講到無米粥，唔會講到細節。
English: We're just talking about it without rice porridge, we won't talk about details yet.

28. 義會
廣東話：舊時冇錢嘅人會參加義會，集合朋友鄰居嘅錢。
English: In the old days, people without money would join a rotating credit association, pooling money from friends and neighbors.

29. 榜文
廣東話：榜文寫喺牆上面，大家都可以睇到。
English: The notice is written on the wall, everyone can see it.

30. MK名
廣東話：佢喺網上用嘅係 MK名，有啲特殊符號。
English: The name he uses online is an MK name, it has some special symbols. [end of text]


